course: dictionary
lesson: 14865
title: Reachable
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Reachable means able to be reached: close enough to get to or touch. Break the word into parts: reach, plus -able, which means can be. So reachable means can be reached.
explain: «The cookie jar is on the top shelf, but a chair makes it reachable.» The chair helps you get close enough to touch the jar, so the jar is reachable. Ask yourself: what would fit in place of reachable? Can I get to it? Then check your meaning in the sentence.
explain: Reachable can also describe a person or a goal. «Mum is reachable by phone all afternoon» means you can contact her. «Our goal is reachable if we practise every day» means we can achieve it.
fact: Reachable means able to be reached: close enough to get to or touch.
fact: The ending -able means can be, so reachable means can be reached.
fact: «The apples on the low branch are reachable.» A child can pick them without climbing.
fact: A reachable person is someone you can contact, such as by phone.
fact: A reachable goal is one you can achieve, if you take it step by step.
exercise: «The apples on the low branch are reachable, so Sam picks one.» What does reachable mean here? | Far away over the hills | Red and shiny | *Close enough to get to and touch | Hard to eat
exercise: «Mum is reachable by phone all afternoon.» What does reachable suggest about Mum? | She has gone to sleep | She cannot hear you | She is lost | *You can contact her
exercise: Ella wants a goal she can achieve in a week. Which word describes a goal like that? | Invisible | Forgotten | Impossible | *Reachable
test: Cleaning products should be kept where they are not reachable by small children. What does this mean? | *They should be kept where small children cannot get to them | They should be kept where small children can easily touch them | They should be kept under the bed | They should be kept in the garden
test: In maths, a square on a grid may be reachable in three moves. What does reachable mean here? | It is painted red | It is bigger than the others | *You can get to it in three moves | You can never get to it
exam: Which word means can be reached? | Unreachable | Reaches | *Reachable | Reacher
